## Recurring LLM Misalignments / Deviations

*   **Repetitive File Reading / Lack of Decisiveness:** The user explicitly stated, "stop spinning around in circles reading the same thing over and over again. Implement decisively." This indicates prior instances where the AI re-read the same files over and over again or analyzed excessively instead of acting on the information and instructions already provided.
*   **Incorrect Implementation Logic (Despite available context)**

